                 triangle+stroke (fill AND stroke both the same gradient, the
                 round join is what actually produces this shape's own rounded
                 corners, not a separate corner radius anywhere), the radial
                 glow clipped to it, and the jellyfish silhouette on top, same
                 real geometry, same real 400x400 coordinate space. -->
